(7698720, 1263355, 67258, '<td valign="top">Love the tones and. textural quality to this.</td>', 'Love the tones and. textural quality to this.', '2021-08-09 08:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7698724, 1263276, 67258, '<td valign="top">I think my favourite of the challenge - the dog head on, capturing the intensity of its focus, the perfect splash, and the reflection all make. it a. winner.   This is much harder to achieve than it looks!  Bumping.</td>', 'I think my favourite of the challenge - the dog head on, capturing the intensity of its focus, the perfect splash, and the reflection all make. it a. winner.   This is much harder to achieve than it looks!  Bumping.', '2021-08-09 09:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7698726, 1263365, 67258, '<td valign="top">A technically good, and well conceived photo - good choice of depth if field, and you nailed that focus!</td>', 'A technically good, and well conceived photo - good choice of depth if field, and you nailed that focus!', '2021-08-09 09:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7698727, 1263363, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very cool abstract image. - made me think of a fish eye, which is fairly apt for splash.</td>', 'Very cool abstract image. - made me think of a fish eye, which is fairly apt for splash.', '2021-08-09 09:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7698729, 1263335, 67258, '<td valign="top">Not the technically most competent in the challenge, with the whites appearing blown on. the plumage,  but nailed it  for cuteness, originality, and a good composition too.  Crawl -  I love it,  too!</td>', 'Not the technically most competent in the challenge, with the whites appearing blown on. the plumage,  but nailed it  for cuteness, originality, and a good composition too.  Crawl -  I love it,  too!', '2021-08-09 09:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7698734, 1263347, 103142, '<td valign="top">Really cool! It looked like a bear, at first! It was gorgeous on my phone, not quite as pretty on my laptop, I assume it will be spectacular on my large, good monitor. It would have been a 6 voting from here. But 8 from my initial reaction on the phone.</td>', 'Really cool! It looked like a bear, at first! It was gorgeous on my phone, not quite as pretty on my laptop, I assume it will be spectacular on my large, good monitor. It would have been a 6 voting from here. But 8 from my initial reaction on the phone.', '2021-08-09 10:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7698736, 1263236, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2021-08-09 10:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7698737, 1263353, 103142, '<td valign="top">Adorable -- but I don''t see a splash!</td>', 'Adorable -- but I don''t see a splash!', '2021-08-09 10:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7698758, 1263363, 103142, '<td valign="top">I find this quite intriguing. There''s only a bit of splash, and yet it''s a huge splash of light. The bits of sparkle on the right add instead of detract -- which surprises me. Not something I''d normally like - but it grabbed me. -8-</td>', 'I find this quite intriguing. There''s only a bit of splash, and yet it''s a huge splash of light. The bits of sparkle on the right add instead of detract -- which surprises me. Not something I''d normally like - but it grabbed me. -8-', '2021-08-09 12:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7698759, 1263359, 103142, '<td valign="top">Really lovely! I wonder what it would look like cropped in even more. The bottom 1/3 seems to draw too much attention, even though it''s not in focus or not silky enough. It''s the upper left/upper middle that are so gorgeous. -7-</td>', 'Really lovely! I wonder what it would look like cropped in even more. The bottom 1/3 seems to draw too much attention, even though it''s not in focus or not silky enough. It''s the upper left/upper middle that are so gorgeous. -7-', '2021-08-09 12:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7698760, 1263355, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s really intriguing, but something just doesn''t seem right. I''m wondering if it was a bit brighter if that would help? It seems like a beautiful song that''s just a bit out of tune...</td>', 'It''s really intriguing, but something just doesn''t seem right. I''m wondering if it was a bit brighter if that would help? It seems like a beautiful song that''s just a bit out of tune...', '2021-08-09 12:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7698761, 1263365, 103142, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... something doesn''t feel right on this one. I''d be curious to see what it would have looked like if the person wasn''t so far to the side. The face isn''t quite out of focus enough, so it draws the eyes away from the interesting part of the photo.</td>', 'Hmmm... something doesn''t feel right on this one. I''d be curious to see what it would have looked like if the person wasn''t so far to the side. The face isn''t quite out of focus enough, so it draws the eyes away from the interesting part of the photo.', '2021-08-09 12:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
